    "chunk_text": "\u00d0IS sind Israhela bearna naman \u00fee mid Iacobe foron on Egypta land; hi foron ealle mid heora hiwum. Ruben, Simeon, Leui & Iuda. Isachar & Zabulon, Beniamin. Dan & Neptalim, Gad & Aser. Witodlice ealra \u00feara manna \u00fee foron on Egypta land & of Iacobes ofspringe w\u00e6ron fif & hundseofonti; & \u00fea he dead w\u00e6s & ealle his gebro\u00feru & his neamagas, Israhela folc weox swilce hi of eor\u00fean Gemang \u00feam aras niwe cyning ofer Egypta land, \u00fee niste hw\u00e6t Iosep w\u00e6s. & cw\u00e6\u00fe to his folce: Nu is Israhela folc micel & strengre \u00feonne we. Gegaderia\u00fe eow wislice, & uton gehynan hit \u00f0\u00e6t hit to menigfeald ne wur\u00f0e; & gyf ure fynd us mid Witodlice he sette him weorca m\u00e6gstras, \u00fe\u00e6t hy gehyndon hi mid hefigum byr\u00feenum, & hi Swa hi swi\u00f0or w\u00e6ron geswencte, swa w\u00e6ron hi swi\u00f0or gemenifylde & weoxon. & \u00f0a Egyptiscan hatedon \u00fea Ysrahelyscan & swencton hi. & to yrm\u00fee heora lyf gel\u00e6ddon mid heardum weorcum clames & tigelan & mid \u00e6lcon \u00feeowdome, \u00fee So\u00f0lice Egypta cyningc cw\u00e6\u00fe to \u00feam \u00feinenum \u00fee \u00feam Ebreiscum wifum \u00feenodon \u00feonne hig bearn So\u00felice \u00fea \u00feinena him ondredon God & ne dydon swa se Egyptisca cync him bebead, ac heoldon \u00fea \u00dea clypode se cyng hi to him, & cw\u00e6\u00fe to him: Hwi woldon gyt \u00fe\u00e6t don",
